        "login": "github-actions[bot]"
      }
    },
    {
      "body": "1. Only the mamba page padding grows, by less than one rounding step per block (2112 → 2304, +9%, for Qwen3.5-35B-A3B at unit 256). I added a warning when rounding grows the block by more than 10%. Such units failed at startup before, so existing configs are unaffected.\r\n2. The block size is derived deterministically, so P and D with the same settings get the same size. Different units mean different block sizes, which NIXL already handles like differing --block-size (it requires divisibility).",
      "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:15:51Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/64624#issuecomment-6606141511",
      "id": 6606141511,
      "updated_at": "2026-11-03T14:15:51Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "emmericp"
      }
    }
